` A declaration of a style rule whose value read something tracked, as the reference makes
` one: the value is evaluated once in a live action of its own to gather what it reads, and the
` association of the object with the site is given an action of the style runtime, made by the
` application's `action`, with those trackers, that runs the declaration's function
` (`emit-style-author`) with what it keeps: the object, the block of the gate in force, or none,
` the layer and the order. Answers the association.
